      "note": [
        "A statistical method is used to protect the data of individuals in the statistics presented. For this reason, the presented totals do not always equal the sum of their reported components. See also section 2.2.6 Model assumptions in the quality declaration documentation on Statistics Sweden’s website.",
        "The statistics are based on where people are registered in relation to where their workplace is located. Individuals who cannot be found at a workplace are reported in the municipality where they are registered.",
        "As of 2024, the method for classifying entrepreneurs has been adjusted. This means that the figures are not fully comparable with data for previous months and years."
